            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-amber-300">0.78 GB</td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 text-cyan-300">0.78 GB</td>
            <td class="px-5 py-3 font-sans text-slate-400">HNSW uses 3.36x more memory due to graph edge lists</td>
          </tr>
